==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[Alpacky]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*5 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Like in most [[Tag Arena Stages]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] is one of the best cats to use. However, some fast-hitting cats like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] or his [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|crazed version]] will be good for the Metal Doges as they only have 30 HP.

There's a cheese strategy that involves holding the [[Metal Doge]]s behind the base with [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]] and destroying the base with Awakened Bahamut Cat. You'll need a minimum of two [[Bouncing Four (Combo)|Money Up]] [[Bento Special (Combo)|M Combos]], a level 35 Green Shell Cat and a level 40 Awakened Bahamut Cat. Send out Green Shell Cat as soon as you can and Awakened Bahamut Cat after it.

Cheese strategy from SilumanTomcat.

